    QUESTION:
    Given a Doubly Linked List of size n,
    delete the head node and return the new head.
    Set prev of new head to null.

    EXAMPLE 1:
        Input  : [null|-1-|2] <-> [1|-2-|3] <-> [2|-3-|null]
        Output : [null|-2-|3] <-> [2|-3-|null]
                  2 <-> 3

    EXAMPLE 2:
        Input  : [null|-5-|7] <-> [5|-7-|8] <-> ... <-> [99|-100-|null]
        Output : [null|-7-|8] <-> ... <-> [99|-100-|null]
                  7 <-> 8 <-> 99 <-> 100

    CONSTRAINTS:
        - 2 <= number of nodes <= 10^3
